From a8d0de96adc6c00fd8ddae192c43eaf49d90b81a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avery Felts <averyfelts@aol.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:55:12 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 35/55] ntdll, server: Add msync, an opt-in shared-memory sync
 backend (WINEMSYNC=1).

From WineForge/MetalSharp (WFUSync): events, mutexes and semaphores live in a shared
memory slot array; uncontended operations and waits complete in the client with atomics
and os_sync_wait_on_address/__ulock, falling back to the server.

(cherry picked from commit bea5fb711be40f9b8c666a262aed48d632ab94f3)
